Q)"What would you optimize first in a slow React application?"
Ans:First, I'd measure the problem using the React DevTools Profiler or browser performance tools. After identifying the bottleneck, I'd choose the appropriate optimization—such as reducing unnecessary re-renders, virtualizing large lists, improving algorithms, lazy loading, or optimizing network requests. I avoid adding optimizations without evidence because they can increase complexity without improving performance.
